  "releaseNotes": "Yassa 1.1.0\n            What's Changed\n            - Updated EXILED dependencies to `9.7.0-rc.2`.\n            - Implemented `IsInteractionAllowedForSpectators` property for the `KeybindOption`.\n            - Refactored `OptionBase` implementations to include `UpdateOption` methods for dynamic option updates.\n            - Added strongly-typed `IValueReceiver_T` interface and introduced type-based value update support.",
